sequenceDiagram
    participant User as External User
    participant Gateway as Kubeflow Gateway<br/>(Ingress)
    participant Frontend as Frontend (nginx)<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Backend as Backend API<br/>4000/TCP HTTP/TLS1.3
    participant AuthN as Auth Middleware<br/>(Header Extraction)
    participant AuthZ as Kubernetes API<br/>SubjectAccessReview
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Controller as Workspace Controller<br/>(/manager)
    participant Webhook as Webhook Service<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,Webhook: User Request Flow

    User->>Gateway: HTTPS request
    Gateway->>Frontend: HTTP/8080<br/>Proxy pass
    Frontend->>Backend: REST API call<br/>HTTP/4000
    Backend->>AuthN: Extract user identity<br/>from proxy headers
    AuthN->>AuthZ: SubjectAccessReview<br/>authorize user action
    AuthZ-->>AuthN: Allowed/Denied
    AuthN-->>Backend: Authenticated identity
    Backend->>K8sAPI: Workspace CRUD<br/>PVC/Secret operations<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI-->>Backend: Response
    Backend-->>Frontend: JSON Response
    Frontend-->>User: Rendered UI

    Note over Controller,K8sAPI: Controller Reconciliation Flow

    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event:<br/>Workspace/WorkspaceKind CR change
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update StatefulSet
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Service
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ServiceAccount
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update RoleBinding
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update HTTPRoute<br/>or VirtualService
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch Pod readiness

    Note over Webhook,K8sAPI: Admission Flow

    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission request<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS
    Webhook->>Webhook: Validate Workspace/<br/>WorkspaceKind constraints
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission response<br/>(allow/deny)
